    "instructions_raw": "[Prepare raspa ]\nPeel mangos and place in blender.\nAdd orange juice, lime juice, and 1 tablespoon of chamoy.\nAdd 1 tsp of tajín.\nBlend well.\nCoat bottom of 4 plastic cups with chamoy.\nEvenly distribute blended mixture into the 4 cups.\nPlace cups in freezer.\n\n[Prepare to eat ]\nDissolve 1/4 tsp of sugar into 1/4 cup of cold water.\nPut contents of one frozen cup into blender.\nUse Ice Crush setting on blender.\nAdd water mixture to blender.\nServe and eat.  Top with chamoy, if desired."
