    "ingredients_raw": "2 cups shredded cooked chicken thighs (6 thighs)\n1 cup shredded Cheddar and Monterey Jack cheese blend (daiya dairy-free cheddar)\n2/3 cup Green salsa (Mrs. Renfro’s or La Costeña)\n1 teaspoon ground cumin\n6 flour tortillas (Tia Rosa - Fajita size)",
